# The special weapons show their beam models. A Borg cube holds a Klingon destroyer with its Holding Beam (F4) and a Borg
# Assimilator drains another with its Auto-Assimilator (F3). All four ships are set to green alert so nothing fires. The
# shots show the beams running, with each beam's crop, and the beams gone after both weapons are ordered off. The fire
# sounds (swbhb.wav, swbauto.wav) play once each at the start; read them from the run's WAV.
# Run it with --layout layouts/special-beams.jsonc; the layout's header comment has the whole command.
wait 0.5
select Held
press Shift+G
select Drained
press Shift+G
select Cube
press Shift+G
select Assimilator
press Shift+G
wait 1
shot before
select Cube
special 4 Held
select Assimilator
special 3 Drained
wait 1
shot running
shot running-cube Cube 2
shot running-assimilator Assimilator 2
expect Held team = 2
expect Drained team = 2
select Cube
special 4
select Assimilator
special 3
wait 0.5
shot ended
wait 2
